==Trivia==
*This is the second ever version to update a Cat Unit's name, the first being [[Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat]].
*This is the second ever instance where a version of The Battle Cats Unite! has content differences from another, the first time was when [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] dropped.
**This further complicates all three versions as Southeast Asia is the most outdated, Japan did not receive updated descriptions from this update, and International version not receiving any Switch-exclusive units.
*This update was a feedback response from the playerbase, as an email was sent to address the typos and mistakes that were present in the game.
